# Before: a narrow 9-step column is taller than the column is wide (aspect under 0.4).
...@neutral-theme
direction: down

receive: Receive order {class: service}
validate: Validate {class: service}
charge: Charge card {class: service}
reserve: Reserve stock {class: service}
pick: Pick {class: service}
pack: Pack {class: service}
print: Print label {class: service}
ship: Ship {class: service}
notify: Notify buyer {class: service}

receive -> validate -> charge -> reserve -> pick -> pack -> print -> ship -> notify: {class: dep}
